Package: truenas-initrd
Architecture: all
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 python3 (>= 3.10),
 initramfs-tools
Replaces: truenas-files
Breaks: truenas-files (<< 999)
Description: TrueNAS initramfs regeneration script
 Reconciles boot-environment configuration files with the TrueNAS
 configuration database and regenerates the initramfs for each
 kernel installed in the target boot environment.
 .
 The script and its sibling stdlib-only `upgrade_pyutils` helper
 package are installed under /usr/libexec/truenas-initrd/. The
 package deliberately ships no Python module under site-packages
 because the script is invoked across boot-environment boundaries
 during install and upgrade, where loading code from the host BE's
 site-packages would risk Python ABI / kernel-feature mismatches.
